\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Dual-manifold failure detection and recovery. The relative and absolute end-effector manifolds agree during nominal execution but diverge when a failure drives the system OOD, exposing an endogenous disagreement score $D_t$. Relative actions provide precise local motion, whereas absolute waypoints project execution toward a stable demonstrated-manifold anchor.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
